OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer has sentence
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man jailed for life for murdering
OL,7,FHenry Nowak has had his minimum prison
OL,8,Fterm increased to 25 years by the Court
OL,9,Fof Appeal.
OL,11,FVickrum Digwa was serving a minimum of
OL,12,F21 years for stabbing 18-year-old
OL,13,Fstudent Nowak with a large dagger in
OL,14,FBelmont Road, Southampton, on 3
OL,15,FDecember 2025.
OL,17,FThe Attorney General referred the case
OL,18,Fto the Court of Appeal on the grounds
OL,19,Fit was "unduly lenient", while Digwa
OL,20,Falso challenged his jail term as
OL,21,F"manifestly excessive".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
