OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer has sentence
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Lady Chief Justice quashed the
OL,7,Fsentence, ruling the original term "did
OL,8,Fnot adequately reflect the overall
OL,9,Fseriousness of the murder".
